CREATE TABLE "MadarWorkTask" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"employeeId" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdById" TEXT NOT NULL,"reviewerId" TEXT NOT NULL,"groupKey" TEXT NOT NULL,"title" TEXT NOT NULL,"description" TEXT NOT NULL,"priority" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'NORMAL',"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'NEW',"progress" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"dueAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"reviewedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTask_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"),CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTask_employeeId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("employeeId") REFERENCES "Employee"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTask_progress_check" CHECK ("progress" BETWEEN 0 AND 100),CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTask_status_check" CHECK ("status" IN ('NEW','IN_PROGRESS','REVIEW','COMPLETED')),CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTask_priority_check" CHECK ("priority" IN ('LOW','NORMAL','HIGH','URGENT')));
CREATE INDEX "MadarWorkTask_employeeId_status_dueAt_idx" ON "MadarWorkTask"("employeeId","status","dueAt");
CREATE INDEX "MadarWorkTask_reviewerId_status_dueAt_idx" ON "MadarWorkTask"("reviewerId","status","dueAt");
CREATE INDEX "MadarWorkTask_groupKey_idx" ON "MadarWorkTask"("groupKey");
CREATE TABLE "MadarWorkTaskComment" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"taskId" TEXT NOT NULL,"authorId" TEXT NOT NULL,"body" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTaskComment_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"),CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTaskComment_taskId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("taskId") REFERENCES "MadarWorkTask"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "MadarWorkTaskComment_taskId_createdAt_idx" ON "MadarWorkTaskComment"("taskId","createdAt");
CREATE TABLE "MadarWorkTaskCheck" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"taskId" TEXT NOT NULL,"title" TEXT NOT NULL,"done" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTaskCheck_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"),CONSTRAINT "MadarWorkTaskCheck_taskId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("taskId") REFERENCES "MadarWorkTask"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "MadarWorkTaskCheck_taskId_idx" ON "MadarWorkTaskCheck"("taskId");
